I just spent way too much time restoring the album cover image of **Outtakes From Evangelion (Vol.1)**.

I found a high quality copy of the illustration at [musicbrainz.org](https://musicbrainz.org/release/b35e7e04-713b-418b-b55d-2196a24a7e40/cover-art) which is incidentally the same file as used by apple music. 
![Outtakes From Evangelion (Vol.1) - Cover Art | =360x](https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music30/v4/b3/e8/88/b3e8886c-a5e5-b179-619d-655ec90bff6d/KICA-3262.jpg/360x360bb.webp)

Direct archive links:
[Front](https://ia601903.us.archive.org/26/items/mbid-b35e7e04-713b-418b-b55d-2196a24a7e40/mbid-b35e7e04-713b-418b-b55d-2196a24a7e40-29299266848.jpg) | 
[Back](https://ia801903.us.archive.org/26/items/mbid-b35e7e04-713b-418b-b55d-2196a24a7e40/mbid-b35e7e04-713b-418b-b55d-2196a24a7e40-30418053647.jpg) | 
[CD](https://ia801903.us.archive.org/26/items/mbid-b35e7e04-713b-418b-b55d-2196a24a7e40/mbid-b35e7e04-713b-418b-b55d-2196a24a7e40-30418055859.jpg)

The artwork was created by Masashi Ichifuru (TGB design) and is a modified version of some concept art by Mahiro Maeda. It depicts phase 2 of the Evangelion Unit-01 pseudo-evolution. It's also called "The Radiant Giant" (光の巨人).

I wanted a version with less noise and without the text but after a few hours of searching I couldn't that.
I discovered that a copy of the original was printed in the **Evangelion Exhibition Catalogue** (Evangelion Ten-Zuroku) which was sold at the [Evangelion Exhibition](https://www.asahi.com/event/evangelion/) in 2013.

![Picture of the book | =360x](https://64.media.tumblr.com/8f95b5383f99fe56c4897f347008139f/tumblr_inline_nsdnnunFNq1reelx0_500.jpg)

I even found [this review](https://literaryeagle.tumblr.com/post/125555731074/for-my-thirty-third-evangelion-book-review-here) which includes scans of some of the illustrations but not the radiant giant sketch. 
![A different radiant giant | =360x](https://64.media.tumblr.com/339d568e0c0e4193684e544fff1ce409/tumblr_inline_nsdnw56oEK1reelx0_500.jpg)

When I already had given up I stumbled across [this twitter post](https://twitter.com/TheOtaking/status/1356203956674899971) with some more scans of the book, including the sketch of the radiant giant:

![Sketch of the radiant giant | =360x](https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EtIz37uWMAQTmfd?format=jpg&name=360x360) 

By combining the color version and the sketch and using [waifu2x](https://waifu2x.udp.jp/) for denoising I was able to restore the album cover image:

![eva_no_text_2+denoise_high.png](https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/wendelin-muth.appspot.com/o/public%2Fcontent%2F3a3b24c7-3414-498a-a06e-0bcb01310ed2.png?alt=media) 

And I have to say, it looks glorious.

