### Note

If the links to the images ever go down and somebody wants them, I have made local copies.

### Update: Super Hi-Res 7080x7080 version

For fun I also just made this super hi-res version. 600dpi for a 30x30cm poster. It's not perfect but I'm not disappointed by how it turned out.  
To get a good upscale quality I used Potrace on the LAB-L/C channels and a mix of Cubic Upscaling and Median Blurs for the H channel.  
You can dowload it [here](https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/wendelin-muth.appspot.com/o/public%2Fcontent%2Fe43006f2-2492-4dd8-a7c1-876fa90cdd55.png?alt=media).